parse.rs

# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
/target/

# Remove Cargo.lock from gitignore if creating an executable, leave it for libraries
# More information here https://doc.rust-lang.org/cargo/guide/cargo-toml-vs-cargo-lock.html
Cargo.lock

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk
*~
*listing
*TikZ
*-dat
*-txt
*-json
*.output
# The runtime the Pages workflow builds. A local build drops a copy beside
# the page so the directory can be served; it is not the repository's.
#
# These live here, at the repository root, and NOT in pages/. The deploy
# copies `pages/.` into the published directory, so a .gitignore under
# pages/ is published too -- and the publish action honours it. Patterns
# without a leading slash match at any depth, so `fumola_wasm.js` under
# pages/ removed both /fumola_wasm.js and /v/<hash>/fumola_wasm.js from the
# live site, and the page could not start.
/pages/fumola_wasm.js
/pages/fumola_wasm_bg.wasm
/pages/web-play/rt/
